messages.content:
Review this patch:
```ts
export async function deleteWorkspace(req, res) {
  const workspaceId = req.params.id
  const userId = req.user.id
  const workspace = await db.workspace.findUnique({ where: { id: workspaceId } })
  if (!workspace) return res.status(404).json({ error: 'not found' })
  await db.workspace.delete({ where: { id: workspaceId } })
  audit.log('workspace_deleted', { workspaceId, userId })
  return res.json({ ok: true })
}
```
Bug: it never checks whether userId is owner/admin of workspace. Also no soft delete, no 2FA confirmation for enterprise workspaces, and no rate limit. Required fix: check membership role in ['owner','admin'], require `confirmToken` if plan === 'enterprise', use deleted_at instead of hard delete, and rate limit 3 deletes/hour/user.
